      "description": "To use `autoSize` you have to set a `width` and `height` to the label and it will\nautomatically increase the font size to fill up the space. The actual `fontSize`\nvalue stays the same.\n",
      "type": [
        {
          "kind": "primitive",
          "name": "Boolean"
