        "android",
        "iphone",
        "ipad",
        "macos"
      ],
      "summary": "Label text.",
      "description": "Use the backslash and letter `n` line feed character combination, ie `\\n`, to force a new\nline.\n\nUse Unicode characters, such as those included in (but not limited to) the\n[Unicode List of Useful Symbols](http://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Unicode/List_of_useful_symbols)\nsection of wikipedia, to insert special characters and symbols.\n\nSee the example in [label](api:Titanium.UI.Label) for a demonstration.\n",
      "type": [
        {
          "kind": "primitive",
          "name": "String"
        }
      ]
    },
